[%# Model scorecard (Oct 10 2026). Data: Comserv::Model::AI2::ModelScorecard %]
<section id="model-scorecard" class="card" style="margin:1em 0;padding:0.8em;">
  <h2>Model scorecard <small>(last [% scorecard.cfg.days %] days, since [% scorecard.since_pt | html %]; built [% scorecard.generated_pt | html %] -
    <a href="?scorecard_refresh=1#model-scorecard">refresh</a>)</small></h2>
  [% IF scorecard.error %]<p class="alert alert-warning">Scorecard unavailable: [% scorecard.error | html %]</p>[% ELSE %]
  <p style="font-size:0.9em">
    <b>Measured</b> (Hermes agent.log + state.db): sessions, calls, data requests (tool calls), wall time (user message &rarr; turn end), tokens, OpenRouter $, Super Grok quota % ([% scorecard.cfg.quota_pct_per_mtok %]%/M tokens, &times;[% scorecard.cfg.long_ctx_weight %] over 200K).
    <b>Heuristic</b> (treat as hints): task type (title/cwd regex), outcome (committed = git commit in the session's repo during the session; abandoned = no finished turn or user spoke last; user-corrected = 2+ correction phrases), clarifications (assistant question phrases), thrash (3+ identical tool calls in a row), tests (PASS/FAIL text in tool output), reverts (later "Revert" commit naming the session's commit).
    Multi-model sessions: the outcome goes to the model of the last turn; earlier models show <i>switched_away</i>.
  </p>
  [% IF scorecard.speed.size %]
  <h3>Time to done per turn (all tasks)</h3>
  <table class="table table-sm" style="width:auto">
    <tr><th>Model</th><th>Turns</th><th>Median s</th><th>p90 s</th><th>API calls / turn</th></tr>
    [% FOREACH s IN scorecard.speed %]
    <tr[% IF s.model.match('glm-5.3-flash|grok-4.7|grok-build') %] style="font-weight:bold"[% END %]><td>[% s.model | html %]</td><td>[% s.turns %]</td><td>[% s.median_s %]</td><td>[% s.p90_s %]</td><td>[% s.calls_per_turn %]</td></tr>
    [% END %]
  </table>
  [% END %]
  <h3>Per model &times; task</h3>
  <div style="overflow-x:auto">
  <table class="table table-sm table-striped" style="font-size:0.85em">
    <tr><th>Task</th><th>Model</th><th>Rating</th><th>Sess</th><th>Calls</th><th>Data req</th><th>Thrash</th><th>Wall h</th><th>Tok M (cached%)</th><th>$</th><th>SG quota %</th>
        <th>Median turn s</th><th>Max-iter turns</th><th>Outcomes</th><th>Corrections</th><th>Clarify</th><th>Tests P/F</th><th>Commits / reverts</th><th>Quality</th><th>$-equiv / result</th><th>min / result</th></tr>
    [% FOREACH r IN scorecard.rows %]
    <tr>
      <td>[% r.task %]</td><td>[% r.model | html %]</td>
      <td><b>[% r.rating.defined ? r.rating : '-' %]</b>[% IF r.rating_note %] <small>([% r.rating_note %])</small>[% END %]</td>
      <td>[% r.sessions %]</td><td>[% r.calls %]</td><td>[% r.data_requests %]</td><td>[% r.thrash %]</td><td>[% r.wall_h %]</td>
      <td>[% r.tokens_m %] ([% r.cached_pct %]%)</td><td>[% r.usd %]</td><td>[% r.quota_pct %]</td>
      <td>[% r.median_turn_s.defined ? r.median_turn_s : '-' %]</td><td>[% r.max_iter_turns %]</td>
      <td>[% FOREACH k IN r.outcomes.keys.sort %][% k %]=[% r.outcomes.$k %] [% END %]</td>
      <td>[% r.corrections %]</td><td>[% r.clarifications %]</td><td>[% r.tests_pass %]/[% r.tests_fail %]</td><td>[% r.commits %] / [% r.reverts %]</td>
      <td>[% r.quality %]</td><td>[% r.cost_per_result %]</td><td>[% r.time_per_result_min %]</td>
    </tr>
    [% END %]
  </table>
  </div>
  <form method="post" action="[% c.uri_for('/ai/eval/scorecard_weights') %]" style="margin-top:0.5em">
    <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="[% csrf_token | html %]">
    <b>Rating weights</b> (rating = weighted mean of time score, cost score, quality; time/cost scores are relative to the best model in the same task = 100):
    time <input name="w_time" size="3" value="[% scorecard.cfg.weights.time %]">
    cost <input name="w_cost" size="3" value="[% scorecard.cfg.weights.cost %]">
    quality <input name="w_quality" size="3" value="[% scorecard.cfg.weights.quality %]">
    &nbsp; 1% Super Grok quota = $<input name="quota_pct_usd" size="4" value="[% scorecard.cfg.quota_pct_usd %]">
    &nbsp; days <input name="days" size="3" value="[% scorecard.cfg.days %]">
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">Save</button>
    <small>Stored in data/ai_model_scorecard.json.</small>
  </form>
  [% IF scorecard.notes.size %]<p><small>Notes: [% scorecard.notes.join('; ') | html %]</small></p>[% END %]
  [% END %]
</section>

[%# Cost per Done task (eval #36). Data: Model::AI2::TaskTracker (rated tasks on /ai/tasks). %]
[% IF task_cost %]
<section id="task-cost" class="card" style="margin:1em 0;padding:0.8em;">
  <h2>Cost per finished task <small>(last [% task_cost.days %] days; rate tasks on <a href="[% c.uri_for('/ai/tasks') %]">/ai/tasks</a>)</small></h2>
  [% IF task_cost.error %]<p class="alert alert-warning">Unavailable: [% task_cost.error | html %]</p>[% ELSE %]
  <p style="font-size:0.9em">Tasks are grouped from Hermes sessions and credited to the model of the last session. <b>$ per Done</b> = all OpenRouter $ on that model's tasks (failed ones included) / tasks you rated Done. Super Grok (xai-oauth) and Ollama cost $0 here, so compare them by tokens per Done. [% task_cost.rated %] of [% task_cost.tasks.size %] tasks rated.</p>
  <table class="table table-sm table-striped" style="font-size:0.85em;width:auto">
    <tr><th>Model</th><th>Tasks</th><th>Rated</th><th>Done</th><th>Partial</th><th>Failed</th><th>Done %</th><th>$ total</th><th><b>$ per Done</b></th><th>Tok M per Done</th><th>Active min per Done</th><th>Corrections</th><th>Rewrites 3+</th></tr>
    [% FOREACH g IN task_cost.summary %]
    <tr><td>[% g.model | html %]</td><td>[% g.tasks %]</td><td>[% g.rated %]</td><td>[% g.done %]</td><td>[% g.partial %]</td><td>[% g.failed %]</td>
      <td>[% g.done_rate_pct.defined ? g.done_rate_pct _ '%' : '-' %]</td><td>[% g.usd %]</td>
      <td><b>[% g.usd_per_done.defined ? g.usd_per_done : '-' %]</b></td><td>[% g.mtok_per_done.defined ? g.mtok_per_done : '-' %]</td>
      <td>[% g.min_per_done.defined ? g.min_per_done : '-' %]</td><td>[% g.corrections %]</td><td>[% g.rewrites %]</td></tr>
    [% END %]
  </table>
  [% END %]
</section>
[% END %]
